  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"2007-09-13T17:00:00Z\"\u003e14 September 2007\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  Decision by Director of Security\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Helen Clark\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    NZ Security Intelligence Service\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;The Director of Security has advised me of his decision regarding Mr Zaoui\u0026#39;s security risk status,\u0026#34; Helen Clark said.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;This is an independent statutory decision, as it always is in such matters, and the Director has my full confidence.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "\"The Director of Security has advised me of his decision regarding Mr Zaoui's security risk status,\" Helen Clark said. \"This is an independent statutory decision, as it always is in such matters, and the Director has my full confidence.\"",
